{"id":"c803835be7de786d","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-consistent-oracle-axioms.md","title":"可相容的枚举泛函公理","display":"df-consistent-oracle-axioms — 可相容的枚举泛函公理","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-consistent-oracle-axioms","aliases":["20-df-consistent-oracle-axioms"],"display":"df-consistent-oracle-axioms — 可相容的枚举泛函公理","chapter":"3","section":"3.3.2","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Theorem 3.3.8 的公理化展开","source_printed_pages":[56],"source_pdf_pages":[92],"depends_on":["[[20-df-strings]]","[[20-df-re]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-consistent-oracle-axioms"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-consistent-oracle-axioms</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-consistent-oracle-axioms — 可相容的枚举泛函公理"},{"key":"chapter","html":"3"},{"key":"section","html":"3.3.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 3.3.8 的公理化展开"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\omega^2\">\\(G\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\omega^2\\)</span>；三元组固定有效编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\parallel\\tau\">\\(\\sigma\\parallel\\tau\\)</span> 表示二者具有共同延伸。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}consistent-oracle-axioms}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Consistent}(G)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\sigma,\\tau,x,y,z\\\n[((\\sigma,x,y)\\in G\\land(\\tau,x,z)\\in G\\land\\sigma\\parallel\\tau)\\Rightarrow y=z],\\\\\n\\Psi_G^A(x)\\downarrow=y\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists\\sigma\\preceq A\\ [(\\sigma,x,y)\\in G]\n\\quad(\\operatorname{Consistent}(G)).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}consistent-oracle-axioms}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Consistent}(G)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\sigma,\\tau,x,y,z\\\n[((\\sigma,x,y)\\in G\\land(\\tau,x,z)\\in G\\land\\sigma\\parallel\\tau)\\Rightarrow y=z],\\\\\n\\Psi_G^A(x)\\downarrow=y\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists\\sigma\\preceq A\\ [(\\sigma,x,y)\\in G]\n\\quad(\\operatorname{Consistent}(G)).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>相容性让右侧成为单值部分函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 不必向延伸封闭；它的向上闭包与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 给出同一泛函。此处定义的是公理集的语义，不把任意集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 都假定为有效程序。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 3.3.8 的公理化展开；印刷页 56；PDF 第 92 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-strings]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-re]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-re]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G\\subseteq2^{<\\omega}\\times\\omega^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\parallel\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}consistent-oracle-axioms}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Consistent}(G)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\sigma,\\tau,x,y,z\\\n[((\\sigma,x,y)\\in G\\land(\\tau,x,z)\\in G\\land\\sigma\\parallel\\tau)\\Rightarrow y=z],\\\\\n\\Psi_G^A(x)\\downarrow=y\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists\\sigma\\preceq A\\ [(\\sigma,x,y)\\in G]\n\\quad(\\operatorname{Consistent}(G)).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false}],"bytes":1497,"backlinks":[{"id":"e213840be81d01b8","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-consistent-oracle-axioms]]。"},{"id":"c2da0adcaefcf021","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-consistent-oracle-axioms]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]。"}],"outgoing":["755e421576224435","60af447f5d59a8dc"]}